  "prefLabel": "He-W 511.07 Wrap Around Coverage",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 511.07 Wrap Around Coverage.\n\n(a) If the employer group health plan does not cover the full range of medicaid services, the medicaid recipient shall receive wrap-around services through fee-for-service medicaid.\n\n(b) Non-medicaid eligible family members, covered by the employer group health plan, shall not be eligible to receive wrap around services.\n\nSource. #10632, eff 7-1-14; ss by #14075, eff 9-20-24, EXPIRES: 9-20-34",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
}
